> It's a long standing issue that IRC chat that most Lojbanists use is out
> of fashion in the modern days internet.
>
> We now have a new gateway to it from another popular app, Telegram
> <http://telegram.org> instant messenger.
>
> So to get connected to Lojban chat and to be able to read the history of
> the chat from the day you joined like pros in Lojban do
> you now have the following options:
>
> 1. In Telegram search find "lojban" user (@lojban) and ask 'em to add you
> to the chat.
>
> Alternatively,
> 2. http://vrici.lojban.org:3001 Submit your email and get an invite to
> http://lojban.slack.com in your e-mail inbox.
>
> Alternatively,
> 3. Use IRC chat directly via
> http://kiwiirc.com/client/irc.freenode.net/?#jbosnu,#ckule,#lojban
>
> The Era of Lojban IRC Detachment is over. Congrats!
>
> P.S. Direct links to join Telegram Lojban chat won't be posted here to
> prevent spammers from infiltrating. As of now there is no technical means
> of making gateways to other instant messengers like WhatsApp and LINE.
>



I'm posting here some permanent links for joining Lojban chats in Telegram
instant messenger. They will work for some time until cracked
by infiltrators:

#lojban main channel -
http://lojban.github.io/sinxa-lo-judri/lojban-telegram.html
#ckule  - school -
http://lojban.github.io/sinxa-lo-judri/telegram-ckule.html
#jbosnu - discussions in Lojban only
http://lojban.github.io/sinxa-lo-judri/telegram-jbosnu.html
#spero - por parolantoj de Esperanto kiuj lernas Lo=C4=B5banon
http://lojban.github.io/sinxa-lo-judri/telegram-lojbo-spero.html


Again note that if you are already using Lojban Slack or Lojban IRC then
these links are only an alternative way to join the same Slack/IRC channels=
.

